### 用户注册
POST http://localhost:8081/api/user/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": "u1001",
  "username": "张三",
  "passwordHash": "password123",
  "role": "student",
  "email": "u1001@example.com"
}

### 用户登录（表单）
POST http://localhost:8081/api/user/login
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

userId=S003&password=123456

### 获取用户信息（将上一步返回的token替换到下行）
GET http://localhost:8081/api/user/S003
Authorization: Bearer ddd8e115-9987-4423-a62a-1c7d4c3ea75a

### 教师注册（示例）
POST http://localhost:8081/api/user/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": "t2001",
  "username": "李老师",
  "passwordHash": "teacher123",
  "role": "teacher",
  "email": "t2001@example.com"
}

### 教师登录
POST http://localhost:8081/api/user/login
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded
userId=t2001&password=teacher123

### 获取教师信息（替换token）
GET http://localhost:8081/api/user/t2001
Authorization: Bearer REPLACE_WITH_TOKEN

### 健康检查
GET http://localhost:8081/actuator/health
